From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Bruno=20Greg=C3=B3rio?= <accounts@bruno.pw>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:21:53 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246: Link
 the flash LED to the main camera
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The rear LED sits next to the main camera, whose module the vendor's
tree pairs it with, so name it as the IMX582's flash.

Signed-off-by: Bruno Gregório <accounts@bruno.pw>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts
index e9eadff41..8b202b4e2 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts
@@ -510,6 +510,7 @@ camera@1a {
 		pinctrl-0 = <&cam_mclk0_default &cam_main_reset>;
 		pinctrl-names = "default";
 
+		flash-leds = <&cam_flash>;
 		lens-focus = <&cam_main_vcm>;
 
 		orientation = <1>;
